<%# views/partials/casino-chat.ejs - 1.99ajw casino2 (owner point 18): the table's 💬 Chat panel - a pad's chat window framed beside the felt
    (public/js/casino-chat.js; the 💬 Chat pill is in partials/casino-top.ejs). Desktop: docked at the inline end; 761-1099px: a float;
    phones: a bottom sheet. The frame comes and goes with the panel (its poll, audio and presence with it). Included by both table pages.
    Review fixes: the table is centred in the room left of the docked panel (and the footer makes room too); the float and the sheet make
    room while the table needs you (your turn, a Blackjack bet or insurance - body.cz-chat-act); a phone's sticky action dock rides above an
    open sheet then; a sheet / float grows while a sheet is open in the chat (cz-chat-tall: ⚔️ Duel's stake); a chat that moved to its own
    window collapses to the bar with Bring it here (cz-chat-retired).
    tablechat (owner 2026-11-07: any pad's chat from a table, advertised there or not): ▾ (and 💬 with no pad of the table's own) opens the
    PICKER in the panel (casino-chat.js builds it: a search box, the table's pads, Recent, More pads - body.cz-chat-pk-on; the frame keeps
    running under it); it makes the float / the sheet tall so a phone's keyboard leaves the list in view - review: not while the table
    needs you (body.cz-chat-act: Fold / Call / Raise stay above it); a 44px Back on a phone; .cz-chat-sub = "Not this table's chat" under
    the name of a pad that isn't the table's. %>
<style>
  body { --czc-w: 360px; --czc-sheet: min(60dvh, 540px); }
  body.cz-chat-float { --czc-w: 340px; }
  .cz-chat { position: fixed; z-index: var(--ds-z-sticky); display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0;
             background: var(--ds-surface, #18181b); color: var(--ds-text, #eee); border: 1px solid var(--ds-line, rgba(255,255,255,.12)); box-shadow: var(--ds-e-3, 0 8px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.45)); }
  .cz-chat[hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .cz-chat-h { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--ds-sp-1, 4px); min-height: 44px; padding: 0 var(--ds-sp-1, 4px) 0 var(--ds-sp-3, 12px); border-block-end: 1px solid var(--ds-line, rgba(255,255,255,.12)); }
  .cz-chat-h .ds-ic { flex: none; }
  .cz-chat-n { flex: 0 1 auto; min-width: 0; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; font: 700 var(--ds-fs-sm, 14px)/1.2 var(--ds-font); }
  .cz-chat-n a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .cz-chat-n a:is(:hover, :focus-visible) { text-decoration: underline; }
  .cz-chat-h .cz-chat-sp { flex: 1 1 auto; }
  .cz-chat-dot { flex: none; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ds-gold, #ffd740); }
  .cz-chat-dot[hidden] { display: none; }
  .cz-chat-h button { flex: none; display: inline-grid; place-items: center; min-width: 40px; min-height: 40px; margin: 0; padding: 0 6px; border: 0; border-radius: var(--ds-r-md, 10px);
                      background: transparent; color: var(--ds-text-muted, #aaa); font: 16px/1 var(--ds-font-emoji, inherit); cursor: pointer; }
  .cz-chat-h button:is(:hover, :focus-visible) { color: var(--ds-text, #fff); background: var(--ds-hover, rgba(255,255,255,.08)); }
  .cz-chat-h button[hidden] { display: none; }
  .cz-chat-b { position: relative; flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 0; }
  .cz-chat-f { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0; background: var(--ds-bg, #111); }
  .cz-chat-bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--ds-sp-2, 8px); padding: var(--ds-sp-3, 12px); font-size: var(--ds-fs-sm, 14px); }
  .cz-chat-bar[hidden] { display: none; }
  .cz-chat-bar-t { flex: 1 1 12ch; min-width: 0; }
  /* desktop: docked at the inline end; the table column makes room (the felt keeps its shape and shrinks - casino-hm.ejs draws a narrowed
     felt's seats smaller) and is centred in the room left of the panel; the footer makes room too */
  body.cz-chat-dock .cz-chat { inset-block: var(--czc-top, 64px) 0; inset-inline-end: 0; width: var(--czc-w); border-inline-end: 0; border-block-end: 0; border-radius: var(--ds-r-xl, 16px) 0 0 0; }
  body.cz-chat-dock:not(.cz-chat-mini) main.cz { margin-inline-start: max(var(--ds-sp-3, 12px), calc((100% - var(--czc-w) - 1120px) / 2)); margin-inline-end: auto;
                                                 max-width: min(1120px, calc(100% - var(--czc-w) - 2 * var(--ds-sp-3, 12px))); }
  body.cz-chat-dock:not(.cz-chat-mini) .site-foot { margin-inline-end: var(--czc-w); }
  /* 761-1099px: a float at the inline-end bottom corner (the page scrolls clear of its minimized bar) */
  body.cz-chat-float .cz-chat { inset-inline-end: var(--ds-sp-3, 12px); inset-block-end: var(--ds-sp-3, 12px); width: var(--czc-w); height: min(560px, calc(100dvh - 96px)); border-radius: var(--ds-r-xl, 16px); overflow: hidden; }
  body.cz-chat-float main.cz { padding-block-end: calc(44px + var(--ds-sp-6, 24px)); }
  /* phones: a non-modal bottom sheet - over half the screen - over the page's foot (the page scrolls clear of it) */
  body.cz-chat-sheet .cz-chat { inset-inline: 0; inset-block-end: 0; height: var(--czc-sheet); border-radius: var(--ds-r-xl, 16px) var(--ds-r-xl, 16px) 0 0; border-block-end: 0; overflow: hidden;
                                padding-block-end: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px); }
  body.cz-chat-sheet main.cz { padding-block-end: calc(var(--czc-sheet) + var(--ds-sp-4, 16px)); }
  /* a sheet open in the chat (⚔️ Duel's stake, a person's More…): the sheet / float grows so its buttons fit */
  body.cz-chat-tall.cz-chat-sheet:not(.cz-chat-mini) .cz-chat { height: min(88dvh, calc(100dvh - 40px)); }
  body.cz-chat-tall.cz-chat-float:not(.cz-chat-mini) .cz-chat { height: calc(100dvh - 2 * var(--ds-sp-3, 12px)); }
  /* minimized: the 44px bar alone (the frame keeps running underneath: lines keep coming, the audio keeps playing) */
  body.cz-chat-mini .cz-chat { height: 44px; inset-block-start: auto; width: min(var(--czc-w), calc(100vw - 2 * var(--ds-sp-3, 12px))); border-radius: var(--ds-r-xl, 16px); inset-block-end: var(--ds-sp-3, 12px); inset-inline-end: var(--ds-sp-3, 12px); border: 1px solid var(--ds-line, rgba(255,255,255,.12)); }
  body.cz-chat-mini .cz-chat-b, body.cz-chat-mini .cz-chat-bar { visibility: hidden; height: 0; flex: 0 0 0; overflow: hidden; }
  body.cz-chat-mini .cz-chat-h { border-block-end: 0; }
  body.cz-chat-sheet.cz-chat-mini .cz-chat { inset-inline: var(--ds-sp-2, 8px); width: auto; inset-block-end: calc(var(--ds-sp-2, 8px) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)); }
  body.cz-chat-sheet.cz-chat-mini main.cz { padding-block-end: calc(44px + var(--ds-sp-6, 24px)); }
  /* moved to its own window: the bar with Bring it here, nothing else (a docked table gets its width back) */
  body.cz-chat-mini.cz-chat-retired .cz-chat { height: auto; }
  body.cz-chat-mini.cz-chat-retired .cz-chat-bar { visibility: visible; height: auto; flex: 0 0 auto; overflow: visible; padding-block-start: 0; }
  body.cz-chat-retired .cz-chat-min, body.cz-chat-retired .cz-chat-win { display: none; }
  /* (the phone's sticky action dock rides above the minimized bar, and above the open sheet while the table needs you) */
  body.cz-chat-sheet.cz-chat-mini .cz .dock { inset-block-end: calc(52px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)); }
  body.cz-chat-sheet.cz-chat-act:not(.cz-chat-mini) .cz .dock { inset-block-end: calc(var(--czc-sheet) + var(--ds-sp-2, 8px)); }
  /* tablechat: the picker - every pad chat this viewer may open (casino-chat.js) - in the panel, over the frame (which keeps running) */
  .cz-chat-pk { display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 0; outline: 0; }
  .cz-chat-pk[hidden], body.cz-chat-mini .cz-chat-pk { display: none !important; }
  body.cz-chat-pk-on .cz-chat-b, body.cz-chat-pk-on .cz-chat-bar { visibility: hidden; height: 0; flex: 0 0 0; overflow: hidden; padding: 0; }
  .cz-pk-top { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--ds-sp-2, 8px); padding: var(--ds-sp-2, 8px) var(--ds-sp-3, 12px); border-block-end: 1px solid var(--ds-line, rgba(255,255,255,.12)); }
  .cz-pk-back { align-self: flex-start; min-height: 32px; margin: 0; padding: 0 var(--ds-sp-2, 8px); border: 0; border-radius: var(--ds-r-md, 10px); background: transparent;
                color: var(--ds-text-muted, #aaa); font: 600 13px/1.2 var(--ds-font); cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .cz-pk-back:is(:hover, :focus-visible) { color: var(--ds-text, #fff); background: var(--ds-hover, rgba(255,255,255,.08)); }
  .cz-pk-back[hidden] { display: none; }
  /* (review: a 44px target on a phone) */
  body.cz-chat-sheet .cz-pk-back { min-height: 44px; }
  /* review: a chat that isn't this table's pad says so under its name (the people at the table may not be there) */
  .cz-chat-n:has(.cz-chat-sub) a, .cz-chat-sub { display: block; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .cz-chat-sub { color: var(--ds-text-muted, #a1a1aa); font: 500 11px/1.25 var(--ds-font); }
  .cz-pk-ql { position: relative; display: block; margin: 0; }
  .cz-pk-ql .ds-ic { position: absolute; inset-inline-start: 12px; inset-block-start: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); font-size: 14px; pointer-events: none; opacity: .75; }
  /* (16px text: iPhone WebKit doesn't zoom the page on focus) */
  .cz-pk-q { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; min-height: 44px; margin: 0; padding: 0 var(--ds-sp-3, 12px) 0 36px; border: 1px solid var(--ds-line, rgba(255,255,255,.16)); border-radius: var(--ds-r-md, 10px);
             background: var(--ds-surface-2, #232327); color: var(--ds-text, #eee); font: 16px/1.25 var(--ds-font); -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none; }
  .cz-pk-q::placeholder { color: var(--ds-text-muted, #a1a1aa); opacity: 1; }
  .cz-pk-q:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ds-focus, #ffd740); outline-offset: 1px; }
  .cz-pk-l { flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 0; overflow-y: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; padding-block: var(--ds-sp-1, 4px) var(--ds-sp-2, 8px); }
  .cz-pk-h { margin: var(--ds-sp-2, 8px) var(--ds-sp-3, 12px) 2px; color: var(--ds-text-muted, #a1a1aa); font: 700 11px/1.3 var(--ds-font); letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .cz-pk-i { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--ds-sp-3, 12px); box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; min-height: 52px; margin: 0; padding: 6px var(--ds-sp-3, 12px); border: 0;
             background: none; color: inherit; font: inherit; text-align: start; cursor: pointer; }
  .cz-pk-i:hover { background: var(--ds-hover, rgba(255,255,255,.06)); }
  .cz-pk-i:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ds-focus, #ffd740); outline-offset: -2px; background: var(--ds-hover, rgba(255,255,255,.06)); }
  .cz-pk-ic { flex: none; width: 22px; text-align: center; font: 16px/1 var(--ds-font-emoji, inherit); }
  .cz-pk-t { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; }
  .cz-pk-n, .cz-pk-m { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .cz-pk-n { color: var(--ds-text, #eee); font: 600 var(--ds-fs-sm, 14px)/1.25 var(--ds-font); }
  .cz-pk-m { color: var(--ds-text-muted, #a1a1aa); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .cz-pk-i[aria-current="true"] .cz-pk-n { color: var(--ds-text-strong, #fff); font-weight: 700; }
  .cz-pk-i[aria-current="true"] .cz-pk-ic { color: var(--gold, #ffd740); }
  .cz-pk-st { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--ds-sp-2, 8px); margin: 0; padding: var(--ds-sp-2, 8px) var(--ds-sp-3, 12px) var(--ds-sp-3, 12px); color: var(--ds-text-muted, #a1a1aa); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .cz-pk-st[hidden], .cz-pk-foot[hidden] { display: none; }
  .cz-pk-foot { margin: 0; padding: var(--ds-sp-2, 8px) var(--ds-sp-3, 12px) calc(var(--ds-sp-3, 12px) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)); border-block-start: 1px solid var(--ds-line, rgba(255,255,255,.12)); font-size: 13px; }
  .cz-pk-foot a { color: var(--gold, #ffd740); }
  .cz-chat-pick[aria-expanded="true"] { color: var(--ds-text, #fff); background: var(--ds-hover, rgba(255,255,255,.08)); }
  /* the 💬 pill while the chat is open here */
  #cz-chatbtn[aria-expanded="true"] { border-color: var(--gold); background: rgba(255,215,64,.12); color: var(--ds-text-strong, #fff); }
  /* 1.99ajw casino2: a seat's avatar + name as the person menu's button (casino-ui.js seatWho) - the seat's own look */
  .cz .cz-who { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; max-width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 12px; background: none; color: inherit; font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
  .cz .bj-dealer .cz-who { flex-direction: row; gap: 8px; }
  .cz .cz-who:hover .plate { border-color: var(--gold); }
  .cz .cz-who:hover .felt-lbl { color: #fff; }
  .cz .cz-who:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ds-focus); outline-offset: 3px; }
  /* the person menu on a table page: its avatar is the Dock's 32px disc, not the felt's 48px seat ring */
  body.cz-pm .pm-pop.rmd-pm .pm-pop-n .av { border: 0; box-shadow: none; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; background: var(--ds-surface-2, #2a2a2e); color: var(--ds-text, #eee); position: relative; }
  body.cz-pm .pm-pop.rmd-pm .pm-pop-n .av img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 50%; }
  body.cz-pm .pm-pop.rmd-pm .pm-pop-n .who { color: var(--ds-text-strong, #fff); }
  body.cz-pm .pm-pop.rmd-pm .pm-pop-n > .cz-pm-role { font-family: var(--ds-font); }   /* (Pepe's role line isn't a Camfrog login) */
  /* 1.99ajw casino2 rework: a masked seat (an incognito / hidden player - casino/veil.js): no picture, a plain frog on a muted disc, on the
     felt and in its small menu (casino-ui.js avatarHTML / veilMenu), whose one line says only that they play incognito */
  .cz .av.veil { background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #4b4b55, #1c1c22); font-size: 22px; text-transform: none; }
  body.cz-pm .pm-pop.rmd-pm .pm-pop-n .av.veil { font-size: 17px; }
  body.cz-pm .pm-pop.cz-veilm .cz-pm-note { margin: 0; padding: var(--ds-sp-2, 8px) var(--ds-sp-3, 12px) var(--ds-sp-3, 12px); color: var(--ds-text-muted, #a1a1aa); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; max-width: 260px; }
</style>
<aside class="cz-chat" id="cz-chat" hidden aria-labelledby="cz-chat-n">
  <div class="cz-chat-h">
    <span class="ds-ic" aria-hidden="true">💬</span>
    <h2 class="cz-chat-n" id="cz-chat-n"></h2>
    <button type="button" class="cz-chat-pick" hidden aria-controls="cz-chat-pk" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="<%- t('casino.chat_switch') %>" title="<%- t('casino.chat_switch') %>"><span class="ds-ic" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button>
    <span class="cz-chat-dot" role="img" aria-label="<%- t('casino.chat_new') %>" hidden></span>
    <span class="cz-chat-sp"></span>
    <button type="button" class="cz-chat-win" aria-label="<%- t('casino.chat_window') %>" title="<%- t('casino.chat_window') %>"><span class="ds-ic" aria-hidden="true">↗️</span></button>
    <button type="button" class="cz-chat-min" aria-label="<%- t('casino.chat_min') %>" title="<%- t('casino.chat_min') %>"><span class="ds-ic" aria-hidden="true">➖</span></button>
    <button type="button" class="cz-chat-x" aria-label="<%- t('casino.chat_close') %>" title="<%- t('casino.chat_close') %>"><span class="ds-ic" aria-hidden="true">✕</span></button>
  </div>
  <div class="cz-chat-bar" role="status" hidden><span class="cz-chat-bar-t"></span><button type="button" class="cz-btn sm ghost"><%- t('casino.chat_bring') %></button></div>
  <div class="cz-chat-b"></div>
</aside>
<script src="/public/js/casino-chat.js?v=2" defer></script>
